flowchart TD
    human([Human user]) -->|Free-text music request| ui[Streamlit app<br/>app.py]
    catalog[(data/songs.csv<br/>18-song catalog)] --> loader[Catalog loader]
    ui --> agent[Hybrid recommendation agent<br/>src/hybrid.py]
    loader --> agent

    agent --> extract{Extract preferences}
    extract -->|API key available| llm[OpenAI-compatible LLM]
    extract -->|Missing key or invalid response| fallback[Deterministic fallback parser]
    llm --> prefs[Structured preferences<br/>genre, mood, energy, acousticness]
    fallback --> prefs

    prefs --> scorer[Deterministic weighted scorer<br/>src/recommender.py]
    catalog --> scorer
    scorer --> rank[Score all songs<br/>select top K]

    rank --> explain{Generate grounded explanations}
    explain -->|Retrieved metadata only| explainer[LLM explanation generator]
    explain -->|LLM unavailable| templates[Grounded template explanations]
    explainer --> output[Ranked songs<br/>scores + explanations]
    templates --> output
    rank --> output
    output --> ui

    subgraph validation [Testing and human validation]
        tests[pytest tests/test_recommender.py]
        mocks[Mocked LLM responses]
        smoke[Manual smoke test]
        review([Human reviews relevance<br/>and explanation grounding])
    end

    tests --> scorer
    tests --> fallback
    mocks --> explainer
    smoke --> ui
    output --> review
    review -. feedback .-> ui
